---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <main class="min-h-screen max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <p class="section-label border-b border-accent pb-2 mb-6 inline-block">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold font-display mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-ink-light leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        UnderTheInfluence is a public interest investigation into political funding in the United Kingdom.
        All data presented on this site is sourced from publicly available records.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-ink pt-4">Data We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not use cookies, tracking scripts, or analytics.
        We do not collect personal data from visitors.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-ink pt-4">Data Sources</h2>
      <p>
        Political donation data is sourced from the Electoral Commission and the MPs' Register of Interests.
        Ministerial meeting data is sourced from GOV.UK transparency returns.
        Lobbying data is sourced from the ORCR register.
        All data is publicly available.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-display text-ink pt-4">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about this privacy policy or the data presented on this site,
        please contact us via the project's GitHub repository.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
